(:id "union-field-arms/c/valid-data" :state :unknown :note "the direct text, byte-buffer and array arm clauses are unproved: the shared fixed-form gate ir.TableFixedSupported ADMITS a direct text/bytes/array arm (an arm is a field line, SPEC-TABLES §2.6), now pinned by ir/fixedform_arms_test.go:TestTableFixedSupportedAdmitsDirectAndPayloadFreeArms, so the live blocker is this leg's fixed emitter (internal/codegen/ctable/fixedform.go) and the c card that adds a fixture asserting their storage, not ir/fixedform.go; the roadmap calls text nested inside a named type arm a different supported case (docs/roadmap.sexp:6675). The admitted type-arm shape — a scalar, a text field and an array nested inside a type the arm names — is asserted at internal/codegen/ctable/fixedroadmap_t10_test.go:TestFixedRoadmapCT10FloatsUnions/union-field-arms/c/valid-data")
(:id "payload-free-arms/c/valid-data" :state :unknown :note "a declared payload-free union arm is a bare name (v.F == nil) and the shared fixed-form gate ir.TableFixedSupported ADMITS it — the tag alone is its whole storage (SPEC-TABLES §2.6) — now pinned by ir/fixedform_arms_test.go:TestTableFixedSupportedAdmitsDirectAndPayloadFreeArms, so the live blocker is this leg's fixed emitter (internal/codegen/ctable/fixedform.go) and the c card that asserts the tag-only arm storage, not ir/fixedform.go; no c fixture writes and reads such a root yet, and a tag named None is not a declared payload-free arm, so no capability assertion is possible on this leg.")
